-send-ashley-moody-back-to-the-senate-defeat-communist-angie-nixon/"},{"issue":"Cost of living and student debt","why":"Nixon focuses on rising costs, student debt and low paying jobs for graduates.","src":"https://www.wuft.org/politics/2026-10-19/bernie-sanders-and-angie-nixon-rally-thousands-at-uf-encouraging-young-voters-to-head-to-polls"},{"issue":"Health coverage","why":"Nixon says Moody voted to end health care for over 440,000 Floridians.","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/media/florida-senate-candidate-angie-nixon-calls-jailing-gop-opponent-ashley-moody"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Sanders rallies thousands with Nixon at UF","date":"2026-10-18","what":"Bernie Sanders and Nixon drew more than 2,800 people in Gainesville, urging young voters to turn out on costs and student debt.","helps":"D","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.wuft.org/politics/2026-10-19/bernie-sanders-and-angie-nixon-rally-thousands-at-uf-encouraging-young-voters-to-head-to-polls"},{"title":"Nixon outraises Moody","date":"2026-10-17","what":"Nixon raised about 2 million dollars more than Moody in the third quarter on a jump in small donors, but still has less cash on hand.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://www.tampabay.com/news/florida-politics/elections/2026/10/17/nixon-moody-senate-campaign-donors/"},{"title":"Nixon says Moody should be jailed","date":"2026-10-14","what":"In a TV interview Nixon said she wants Moody locked up over Hope Florida and would seek an investigation. Moody's campaign called it a tactic from the communist playbook.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/media/florida-senate-candidate-angie-nixon-calls-jailing-gop-opponent-ashley-moody"},{"title":"Moody ad touts tough on crime record","date":"2026-10-14","what":"A Moody ad says she spent her career putting criminals behind bars and that her opponent quotes cop killers, citing Nixon's past praise of Assata Shakur.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/10/ashley-moody-puts-tough-on-crime-resume-against-angie-nixons-radical-approach/"},{"title":"Democrats hit Moody on Hope Florida and access","date":"2026-10-01","what":"Florida Democrats accused Moody of dodging reporters and town halls and revived the Hope Florida controversy. Moody declined to debate Nixon, calling her a self proclaimed socialist.","helps":"D","kind":"scandal","src":"https://www.wusf.org/politics-issues/2026-10-01/democrats-slam-ashley-moody-amid-heated-us-senate-race"},{"title":"Moody ad labels Nixon a socialist","date":"2026-09-28","what":"Moody's ad shows Nixon discussing joining the DSA and frames the race as freedom versus socialism.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/09/ashley-moody-releases-ad-attacking-angie-nixon-as-a-socialist-ties-to-dsa/"},{"title":"Trump endorses Moody","date":"2026-09-18","what":"Trump released a video fully endorsing Moody, crediting her tax cut and border votes, and called Nixon a communist.","helps":"R","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://flvoicenews.com/trump-send-ashley-moody-back-to-the-senate-defeat-communist-angie-nixon/"}],"events":[{"title":"The socialist label","prompt":"Attack ads hammer one candidate's membership in the Democratic Socialists of America. Reporters ask whether the label fits.","issue":"other","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/09/ashley-moody-releases-ad-attacking-angie-nixon-as-a-socialist-ties-to-dsa/","opts":[{"label":"Own the left lane","say":"Embrace a progressive agenda on wages, housing and health care.","pos":-0.9,"trump":-0.8,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Capitalist who regulates","say":"Say you believe in markets with rules and focus on costs.","pos":-0.2,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Freedom versus socialism","say":"Frame the race as a choice between freedom and socialism.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.8,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Hope Florida questions","prompt":"A 10 million dollar Medicaid settlement routed to political committees is back in the news, and report